  m_Text: 'ANDROID / GALAXY A07 REFERENCE TARGET

    30 FPS target. Low/standard
    render scale and shadow distance.

    Assistance affects traction and stability.
    Gameplay menus pause the simulation.

    Performance, rendering and handling
    still require testing on the actual phone.'
